2076103165745735, 0.013525960966944695, 0.022254157811403275, -0.007306434214115143, -0.013306383974850178, -0.021397806704044342, 0.0242632906883955, -0.0005300733027979732, 0.015754669904708862, 0.04330063983798027, 0.035264112055301666, -0.024987895041704178, -0.04676996171474457, 0.01930084452033043, -0.019476504996418953, -0.0069221737794578075, -0.034100353717803955, -0.035725224763154984, 0.0024455420207232237, 0.035944800823926926, 0.02441699430346489, -0.035198237746953964, 0.019092245027422905, -0.003806921187788248, -0.009112457744777203, -0.006411656737327576, 0.04900965094566345, 0.030126003548502922, 0.008338447660207748, -0.026459062471985817, -0.006812385283410549, -0.0014862638199701905, -0.004004540853202343, 0.012197518721222878, -0.01060558296740055, -0.008360405452549458, 0.0015246898401528597, 0.016237741336226463, 0.044969428330659866, 0.03427601605653763]], "input": ["NUTRICIÓN CLÍNICA Y DIETOTERAPIA:Nutrition Clinical and Dietotherapy refers to the practices and protocols developed for nutritional care in clinical settings at Hospital La Fe.", "UNIDAD DE NUTRICIÓN:The \"UNIDAD DE NUTRICIÓN\" is a specialized medical unit within Hospital La Fe that plays a crucial role in the nutritional care of patients. This unit supervises patients on specialized diets to ensure they receive adequate nutrient intake and maintain health safety. It evaluates patients' dietary needs and creates personalized diet plans tailored to individual health conditions and preferences, particularly for those with complex medical issues such as cancer.\n\nIn addition to assessing and adjusting nutrition, the Unidad de Nutrición is responsible for planning and managing dietary codes within the hospital. This includes the calibration of diet menus to ensure nutritional quality and the training of nursing staff on dietary codes and nutrition-related topics. The unit integrates closely with the Service of Endocrinology, highlighting its comprehensive approach to patient care and nutrition management.", "SERVICIO DE ENDOCRINOLOGÍA Y NUTRICIÓN:The Servicio de Endocrinología y Nutrición encompasses medical departments dedicated to the treatment and management of various endocrine and nutritional issues. At the Complejo Hospitalario de Navarra, the service focuses on addressing nutritional problems, ensuring comprehensive care for patients with dietary needs. Additionally, the service is involved in the diagnosis and nutritional follow-up of patients suffering from dysphagia, highlighting its commitment to specialized care in this area. Furthermore, at Hospital La Fe, the Servicio de Endocrinología y Nutrición is responsible for managing a wide range of endocrine and nutritional health services, reinforcing its role in promoting overall health and well-being.", "PROTOCOLS DE NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL:Protocols de Nutrición Enteral are guidelines developed for the administration of enteral nutrition to patients at Hospital La Fe.", "VADEMECUM DE PRODUCTOS DE NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL Y PARENTERAL:The Vademecum de Productos de Nutrición Enteral y Parenteral is a continuously updated reference for nutritional products used in clinical settings at Hospital La Fe.", "PREMIO BEST IN CLASS:The Premio Best in Class is an award recognizing the best nutrition unit, which has been awarded to the Sección de Nutrición at Hospital La Fe.", "AVENIDA FERNANDO ABRIL MARTORELL:", "DR. J.F. MERINO:Dr. J.F. Merino is a medical professional who has invested effort into creating a clinical manual for daily practice in nutrition and disease management.", "DR. MELCHOR HOYOS GARCÍA:Dr. Melchor Hoyos García is the manager of the Department of Health Valencia La Fe, overseeing health initiatives and publications.", "JUAN FRANCISCO MERINO TORRES:Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres is the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at Hospital Universitario y Politécnico La Fe in Valencia. In this role, he contributes to the development of clinical guidelines, showcasing his expertise and leadership in the field of endocrinology and nutrition.", "KATHERINE GARCÍA MALPARTIDA:Katherine García Malpartida is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, involved in clinical practices and patient care.", "MARÍA ARGENTE PLA:María Argente Pla is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, currently working at Hospital Universitario y Politécnico de La Fe in Valencia. She plays a significant role in the healthcare team, utilizing her expertise to provide quality care in her field.", "MATILDE RUBIO ALMANZA:Matilde Rubio Almanza is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, part of the healthcare team.", "MIGUEL PÉREZ GANDÍA:Miguel Pérez Gandía is a nursing diploma holder specializing in Endocrinology and Nutrition.", "SILVIA MARTIN SANCHIS:Silvia Martin Sanchis is a diploma holder in Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics, working in Endocrinology and Nutrition.", "BEATRIZ LEÓN DE ZAYAS:Beatriz León de Zayas is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition, contributing to patient care."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}